###
http://localhost:9000/proxy

### get
http://localhost:9000/proxy?url=https://httpbin.org/get

### post
POST http://localhost:9000/proxy?url=https://httpbin.org/post
accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"some": 1
}

### range
GET http://localhost:9000/proxy?url=https://httpbin.org/range/19
Range: bytes=2-5

### gzip
GET http://localhost:9000/proxy?url=https://httpbin.org/gzip

### redirect: absolute
GET http://localhost:9000/proxy?log&url=https://httpbun.com/redirect-to?url=https://httpbun.com/get
### redirect: relative
GET http://localhost:9000/proxy?log&url=https://httpbun.com/redirect-to/?url=./get
### redirect: from origin
GET http://localhost:9000/proxy?log&url=https://httpbun.com/redirect-to?url=/get
